# Exactness of adjoint functors
%%%
tag := "Chapter7/Exercise7.9.7"
number := false
%%%

*Exercise 7.9.7.* Show that if $`(F, G)` is a pair of adjoint additive functors between abelian categories, then $`F` is right exact and $`G` is left exact.

